; GLSL450 memory model (no Vulkan memory model): memoryBarrier() / memoryBarrierImage() with ImageMemory (0x808 =
; AcquireRelease | ImageMemory) is a device / workgroup fence; one without the image class (shared only, 0x108) is not.
OpCapability Cap:Shader
OpMemoryModel AddrModel:Logical MemModel:GLSL450
OpEntryPoint Model:GLCompute %main "main"
OpExecutionMode %main ExecMode:LocalSize 1 1 1
%void = OpTypeVoid
%fn = OpTypeFunction %void
%u32 = OpTypeInt 32 0
%dev = OpConstant %u32 1
%wg = OpConstant %u32 2
%semimg = OpConstant %u32 2056
%semshared = OpConstant %u32 264
%main = OpFunction %void 0 %fn
%l = OpLabel
OpMemoryBarrier %dev %semimg
OpMemoryBarrier %wg %semimg
OpMemoryBarrier %wg %semshared
OpReturn
OpFunctionEnd
